   "evidence": "Capital city with no territorial armed-group presence. Order is kept by the PNC (Kinshasa provincial police commissariats), which runs recurrent anti-gang sweeps (Operation Ndobo, latest large wave Dec 2025 with most arrests in Masina). Kuluna gangs still assault and rob residents at night (e.g. Bandalungwa, Aug 2026) and insecurity returns between operations, but gangs do not hold or govern neighbourhoods.",
   "source_ids": [
