   "evidence": "The Batéké plateau of Maluku is an operation zone of FARDC Operation Ngemba (14th Military Region) against the Mobondo militia; FARDC clashed with Mobondo at Mbankana (Aug 2025) and Mobondo killed people near Mongata (Feb 2025) and at a Maluku farm (May 2026). A DDR pilot was launched in Mbankana in Dec 2025 and by Jul-Aug 2026 the government reported pacification of Mbankana-Mongata, though residents say holdout Mobondo still occupy outlying farms; towns themselves are state-held.",
